Typora Codex Mermaid

An unofficial integration for Typora. Not affiliated with, endorsed by, or
maintained by OpenAI or Typora.

The extraction and build workflow reads a locally installed Codex application.
Verified application snapshot: 26.924.22138; bundled Mermaid: 11.16.0.
The generated flowchart layout, theme functions, reference implementation and
their dependencies originate from that application. src/renderer.js adapts its
rendering behavior; src/plugin.js and src/viewer.js implement the Typora bridge
and preview interaction.

The Git source distribution excludes extracted vendor modules, the generated
engine, application notices, local verification documents and install archives.
The macOS release ZIP contains the prebuilt engine and the corresponding notices
so users can install without extracting resources from Codex themselves.
During extraction, THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.txt is copied from the application's
Resources directory and included in the local build. It is the application's
full notice collection, not a claim that every listed dependency is used here.

Upstream names, code and licenses retain their existing ownership and terms.
This integration does not relicense the application or its dependencies.
No blanket open-source license is assigned to this mixed-provenance project;
the package metadata retains UNLICENSED. It is a source-sharing project and
local build workflow, not an official SDK or supported extension interface.
